ype-text-long field--label-hidden field__item\"><h1>Paychex WISE: AI for HR, Payroll, and Compliance</h1></div> <div class=\"clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item\"><p>Meet <a href=\"https://www.paychex.com/ai\">Paychex WISE</a>, workforce intelligence designed to help businesses get more done across HR, payroll, compliance, and everyday workforce operations. In this video, see how WISE combines AI with Paychex workforce data to identify issues, reduce routine administrative work, deliver relevant insights, and help businesses act on what needs attention. WISE supports businesses by bringing intelligence into the workflows they already use. Learn how Paychex is applying <a href=\"https://www.paychex.com/corporate/ai-at-paychex\">AI across HR and payroll</a> to help owners spend less time managing routine work and more time focused on their business.</p></div> </div> <div data-datalayer-component-name=\"wysiwyg\" data-datalayer-type=\"wysiwyg\" class=\"paragraph paragraph--type--wysiwyg paragraph--view-mode--default paragraph--class-video-topics\"> <div class=\"clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-compound-heading field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item\"><h2>Topics:</h2></div> <div class=\"clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item\"><ul><li>0:00 - Introduction to Wise AI</li><li>0:10 - WISE for Small Business Owners</li><li>0:20 - Workforce Data and Human Expertise</li><li>0:36 - Workforce Intelligence Across Paychex Products</li></ul></div> </div> <div data-datalayer-component-name=\"wysiwyg\" data-datalayer-type=\"wysiwyg\" class=\"paragraph paragraph--type--wysiwyg paragraph--view-mode--default paragraph--class-video-transcript\"> <div class=\"clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-compound-heading field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item\"><p>&lt;p id=\"transcript-button\"&gt;View Transcript&lt;/p&gt;</p></div> <div class=\"clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item\"><p><strong>Introduction to Wise AI</strong></p><p>0:01 Everyone's talking about AI, but do they really know your business? Meet Wise, the expert enabled AI that gets things done.</p><p><strong>WISE for Small Business Owners</strong></p><p>0:11 Own a small business? Wise spots the issues, handles it, and sends you the update. Run an HR team? Wise takes care of the busy work.</p><p><strong>Workforce Data and Human Expertise</strong></p><p>0:21 You take care of the people. Trillions of data points and human experts who know what to do with them. Your business adviser that sees problems and delivers results where you already work. Imagine what you could do if you didn't have to do it all.</p><p><strong>Workforce Intelligence Across Paychex Products</strong></p><p>0:37 Wise, workforce intelligence strengthened by expertise. Now powering Paychex, Paycor, and SurePayroll.</p></div> </div> <div data-datalayer-component-name=\"cta-full\" data-datalayer-type=\"cta-full\" class=\"paragraph paragraph--type--cta-full paragraph--view-mode--default\"> <div class=\"fullwidth-image-cta columns is-gapless\" data-pg-number=\"\"> <div class=\"column is-two-thirds\"> <div class=\"fullwidth-image-cta-content\"> <div class=\"clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-article-cta-content field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item\"> <div class=\"field field--name-field-compound-heading field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item\"><h2>See What Paychex WISE Can Do for Your Business</h2><p>Discover how Paychex WISE brings AI-powered intelligence into HR, payroll, compliance, hiring, time, benefits, and workforce insights to help businesses reduce routine work and act on what needs attention.</p></div> <div class=\"field field--name-field-p-link field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hi